rule cn.constitution.非法搜查侵犯住宅 :
  params x : cn.constitution.人, h : cn.constitution.住宅
  premise cn.constitution.公民 x
  premise cn.constitution.非法搜查 x h
  conclude cn.constitution.住宅受侵犯 x h
  source text "宪法" locator "第三十九条" version "2018"
         quote "中华人民共和国公民的住宅不受侵犯。禁止非法搜查或者非法侵入公民的住宅。"
         url "http://www.npc.gov.cn/c2/c30834/201905/t20190521_281393.html"
         jurisdiction "CN" retrieved_at "2026-11-22"
         hash "sha256:9aae70936e97a9f380fd0c74e8318c404b0612aaa33b358df83b5ee404a7cf7e"

rule cn.constitution.非法侵入侵犯住宅 :
